' @test valid
' @role test
' @status stable
' @dialect en-standard
' @covers Mod.Goal
' @description Heredoc template with interpolation (D-0050)

RECEIVE source

THINK analysis
  GOAL <<END
Analyze the following data from $source:
- Look for patterns
- Use >> and << freely in text
END
  RESULT
  * summary: TEXT - analysis summary
END

WAIT
  ON ?analysis
END

EXIT
